# Copy to .env for local development. Defaults already point to the local API.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Vercel's own system env var, injected into the build by the platform once
# "Enable access to System Environment Variables" is on for the project. It
# gates all telemetry (src/components/analytics.tsx): only the value
# `production` turns the collectors on, so leave it unset locally on purpose.
# VITE_VERCEL_ENV=

# Absolute origin baked into index.html's og:url/og:image and the manifest
# (src/lib/site-url.ts, #230). Optional — defaults to the production domain
# below; a Vercel preview build can override it with its own preview URL.
# No trailing slash: one is stripped anyway, but the value is clearer without it.
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://kumite.ligadealgoritmos.com
